---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_not_ended: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_not_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_not_ended --> q_revert: revert SaleEnded
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_saft: signature from authorized signer valid
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_saft --> q_check_amount: verify SAFT-approved investAmount and tokenAllocationRate
    q_check_saft --> q_revert: revert InvalidSAFT
    q_check_amount --> q_cache_saft: amount <= cachedInvestAmount (SAFT limit)
    q_check_amount --> q_revert: revert ExceedsSAFTLimit
    q_cache_saft --> q_transfer: cache investAmount and tokenAllocationRate from signature
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> q_set_refund_window: totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_set_refund_window --> [*]: set investor refund deadline = now + refundPeriodSeconds, emit Invested
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_check_saft
        INV-001: SAFT signature encodes maximum investAmount and tokenAllocationRate
        INV-002: tokenAllocationRate uses 18 decimal precision
        INV-003: each invest call refreshes investor individual refund window
    end note

    note right of q_set_refund_window
        INV-004: individual refund period is 14 days per investor last transaction (MiCA compliance)
        INV-005: no predetermined sale end time, continues until manually ended
    end note
